msgid "Passport application status"
msgstr "Momwe pempho la pasipoti lilili"

msgid "Skip to main content"
msgstr "Pitani ku zomwe zili patsamba"

msgid "Malawi Immigration"
msgstr "Zoyang'anira Olowa ndi Kutuluka ku Malawi"

msgid "Language"
msgstr "Chinenero"

msgid "Change colour theme"
msgstr "Sinthani maonekedwe a tsamba"

msgid "Mangochi Immigration Office"
msgstr "Ofesi ya Zoyang'anira Olowa ndi Kutuluka ku Mangochi"

msgid "Call the office"
msgstr "Imbani ku ofesi"

msgid "Try the USSD demo"
msgstr "Yesani USSD yachitsanzo"

msgid "A service from the Department of Immigration and Citizenship Services"
msgstr "Ntchito yochokera ku Dipatimenti Yoyang'anira Olowa ndi Kutuluka ndi Ufulu wa Nzika"

msgid "Check your passport application"
msgstr "Fufuzani momwe pempho lanu la pasipoti lilili"

msgid "Passport services"
msgstr "Ntchito za pasipoti"

msgid "Check the latest update before travelling to the office."
msgstr "Onani uthenga waposachedwa musanapite ku ofesi."

msgid "There is a problem"
msgstr "Pali vuto"

msgid "Check your National ID and phone number or tracking code"
msgstr "Onani ID yanu ndi nambala ya foni kapena tracking code"

msgid "National ID number"
msgstr "Nambala ya ID ya dziko"

msgid "Enter the ID number you gave when you applied."
msgstr "Lowetsani nambala ya ID yomwe munapereka polemba pempho."

msgid "Phone number or tracking code"
msgstr "Nambala ya foni kapena tracking code"

msgid "Use the phone number on your application or the code on your receipt, for example MW-MGC-2026-00042."
msgstr "Gwiritsani ntchito nambala ya foni yomwe munapereka kapena code yomwe ili pa risiti, mwachitsanzo MW-MGC-2026-00042."

msgid "Check status"
msgstr "Fufuzani momwe pempho lilili"

msgid "Your details are checked privately. We never show which detail did not match."
msgstr "Zambiri zanu zimafufuzidwa mwachinsinsi. Sititchula chomwe sichinagwirizane."

msgid "Need help?"
msgstr "Mukufuna thandizo?"

msgid "If your phone number has changed or you entered the wrong one, call Mangochi Immigration Office. Staff will check your ID before changing it."
msgstr "Ngati nambala yanu ya foni yasintha kapena munalowetsa yolakwika, imbani ku ofesi ya Mangochi. Ogwira ntchito adzayang'ana ID yanu asanasinthe nambalayo."

msgid "No internet access?"
msgstr "Mulibe intaneti?"

msgid "Dial *384*123# from the phone number on your application."
msgstr "Imbani *384*123# kuchokera pa nambala ya foni yomwe munapereka."

msgid "Try the demo"
msgstr "Yesani chitsanzo"

msgid "Check your details"
msgstr "Onani zomwe mwalowetsa"

msgid "We could not match those details"
msgstr "Sitinathe kugwirizanitsa zambiri zimenezi"

msgid "For your privacy, check your National ID and phone number or tracking code and try again."
msgstr "Kuti muteteze chinsinsi chanu, onani ID ndi nambala ya foni kapena tracking code, ndipo yesaninso."

msgid "Still need help? Call Mangochi office on"
msgstr "Mukufunabe thandizo? Imbani ku ofesi ya Mangochi pa"

msgid "Application status"
msgstr "Momwe pempho lilili"

msgid "Check another application"
msgstr "Fufuzani pempho lina"

msgid "Passport application"
msgstr "Pempho la pasipoti"

msgid "Application progress"
msgstr "Mmene pempho likuyendera"

msgid "Current stage"
msgstr "Gawo lomwe lilipo"

msgid "Collected"
msgstr "Yatengedwa"

msgid "Last updated"
msgstr "Yasinthidwa komaliza"

msgid "Application type"
msgstr "Mtundu wa pempho"

msgid "Office"
msgstr "Ofesi"

msgid "Collection information"
msgstr "Zokhudza kutenga pasipoti"

msgid "Your passport is ready."
msgstr "Pasipoti yanu yakonzeka."

msgid "Bring your National ID and this tracking code to collect it."
msgstr "Bwerani ndi ID yanu ndi tracking code iyi kuti mutenge pasipoti."

msgid "This passport has been marked as collected."
msgstr "Zalembedwa kuti pasipoti iyi yatengedwa."

msgid "Do not travel to the office yet. We will notify you when your passport is ready."
msgstr "Musapite ku ofesi panobe. Tidzakudziwitsani pasipoti yanu ikakonzeka."

msgid "Address"
msgstr "Adiresi"

msgid "Opening hours"
msgstr "Nthawi zotsegulira"

msgid "Bring"
msgstr "Bwerani ndi"

msgid "Your National ID and this tracking code"
msgstr "ID yanu ndi tracking code iyi"

msgid "Get updates by SMS"
msgstr "Landirani uthenga wa SMS"

msgid "Updates are sent to the phone number on your application:"
msgstr "Uthenga umatumizidwa ku nambala ya foni yomwe munapereka:"

msgid "Wrong number? Applicants cannot change a number online. Call the office; staff will check your ID."
msgstr "Nambala yolakwika? Simungasinthe nambala pa intaneti. Imbani ku ofesi; ogwira ntchito adzayang'ana ID yanu."

msgid "Contact the office"
msgstr "Lumikizanani ndi ofesi"

msgid "Notification history"
msgstr "Mbiri ya mauthenga"

msgid "View message"
msgstr "Onani uthenga"

msgid "No messages have been sent yet."
msgstr "Palibe uthenga womwe watumizidwa panobe."

msgid "If you think these details are wrong, call Mangochi Immigration Office."
msgstr "Ngati mukuganiza kuti zambiri sizolondola, imbani ku ofesi ya Mangochi."

msgid "Staff sign in"
msgstr "Kulowa kwa ogwira ntchito"

msgid "Use your officer account to manage applications."
msgstr "Gwiritsani ntchito akaunti yanu yoyang'anira mapempho."

msgid "Sign-in problem"
msgstr "Vuto lolowa"

msgid "Username"
msgstr "Dzina lolowera"

msgid "Password"
msgstr "Mawu achinsinsi"

msgid "Sign in"
msgstr "Lowani"

msgid "For the project demo, use the credentials in the README."
msgstr "Poyesa polojekitiyi, gwiritsani ntchito dzina ndi mawu achinsinsi omwe ali mu README."

msgid "Feature phone access"
msgstr "Kugwiritsa ntchito foni yosavuta"

msgid "USSD simulator"
msgstr "Choyeserera cha USSD"

msgid "This page sends each menu choice to the same callback endpoint used by the USSD gateway."
msgstr "Tsambali limatumiza chisankho chilichonse ku njira yomweyo yomwe USSD imagwiritsa ntchito."

msgid "Maximum three menu levels"
msgstr "Menyu ili ndi magawo osapitirira atatu"

msgid "Responses stay within 160 characters"
msgstr "Yankho lililonse silidutsa zilembo 160"

msgid "National ID plus tracking code or matching phone"
msgstr "ID kuphatikiza tracking code kapena foni yomwe ikugwirizana"

msgid "Demo shortcut: choose 1, enter a seeded National ID, then enter its tracking code. Seed IDs are numeric; see README."
msgstr "Njira yachidule yoyesera: sankhani 1, lowetsani ID yachitsanzo, kenako tracking code yake. Ma ID a chitsanzo ndi manambala; onani README."

msgid "Return to public status check"
msgstr "Bwererani kukafufuza momwe pempho lilili"

msgid "USSD phone simulator"
msgstr "Choyeserera cha foni ya USSD"

msgid "USSD session"
msgstr "Gawo la USSD"

msgid "Ready"
msgstr "Takonzeka"

msgid "Press Start to connect to *384*123#"
msgstr "Dinani Yambani kuti mulumikizane ndi *384*123#"

msgid "Your reply"
msgstr "Yankho lanu"

msgid "Enter an option, National ID or tracking code."
msgstr "Lowetsani chisankho, ID kapena tracking code."

msgid "Phone keypad"
msgstr "Makiyi a foni"

msgid "Start"
msgstr "Yambani"

msgid "Send"
msgstr "Tumizani"

msgid "Reset"
msgstr "Yambitsaninso"

msgid "Dialling phone number"
msgstr "Nambala ya foni yomwe ikuyimba"

msgid "We could not match those details. Check what you entered or contact Mangochi office."
msgstr "Sitinathe kugwirizanitsa zambiri zimenezi. Onani zomwe mwalowetsa kapena imbani ku ofesi ya Mangochi."

msgid "Sign-in details do not match."
msgstr "Dzina kapena mawu achinsinsi sizikugwirizana."

msgid "Sign-in is temporarily locked. Try again in 15 minutes."
msgstr "Kulowa kwatsekedwa kwakanthawi. Yesaninso pakatha mphindi 15."

msgid "English"
msgstr "Chingelezi"

msgid "Chichewa"
msgstr "Chichewa"

msgid "New passport"
msgstr "Pasipoti yatsopano"

msgid "Renewal"
msgstr "Kukonzanso pasipoti"

msgid "Replacement"
msgstr "Yolowa m'malo"

msgid "Active"
msgstr "Ikugwira ntchito"

msgid "On hold"
msgstr "Yayimitsidwa"

msgid "Rejected"
msgstr "Yakanidwa"

msgid "SMS"
msgstr "SMS"

msgid "Email"
msgstr "Imelo"

msgid "USSD"
msgstr "USSD"

msgid "Queued"
msgstr "Ikudikira kutumizidwa"

msgid "Sent"
msgstr "Yatumizidwa"

msgid "Delivered"
msgstr "Yafika"

msgid "Failed"
msgstr "Yalephera"

msgid "Received"
msgstr "Yalandiridwa"

msgid "Under review"
msgstr "Ikuwunikidwa"

msgid "Approved"
msgstr "Yavomerezedwa"

msgid "Printed"
msgstr "Yasindikizidwa"

msgid "Ready for collection"
msgstr "Yakonzeka kutengedwa"

msgid "Passport status lookup"
msgstr "Kufufuza momwe pasipoti ilili"

msgid "Malawi Immigration emblem"
msgstr "Chizindikiro cha Zoyang'anira Olowa ndi Kutuluka ku Malawi"
